# `call: S S` reads the operator's head in the data: two heads, so the implicit `call` refuses, as a bare name does (the book, an index selects one).
S:
    t: (int: x 2)
    t: (int: x 5)
end: S
int: code 81
---
    call: S S
    catch: call ()
        code: 7
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
